Na kati ya libumu, mwana oyo azali na libumu azingami na makɛlɛlɛ ya pɛtɛɛ mpe ya kokitisa motema, ata mpe makɛlɛlɛ na yango

2
00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:31.870
motema ya mama mpe système digestif mpe mingongo mpe makelele oyo euti na mokili oyo ezali libanda. Ndenge

3
00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:38.750
zemi ekomi na ba étapes na yango ya suka, miso ya bebe ekoki kofungwama na kati ya libumu. Alors que bakoki kosala yango te

4
00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:46.950
nzokande bamonaka bililingi to makambo mikemike, bakoki komona mbongwana na pole. Na yango, nzokande bomoi na libumu ezali kokangama

5
00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:56.840
mpe molili, ezali mosika na kimia. Kobotama ezali mbongwana monene mpo na bebe. Bakoti na mbalakaka

6
00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:03.820
mokili oyo etondi na makambo ya sika, ya kongɛnga mpe makɛlɛlɛ makasi. Komesana na mokili oyo ya sika ezali likambo ya mayoki

7
00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:10.340
kolamuka oyo ebandisaka bokoli na bango. Na mwa bapɔsɔ ya liboso ya bomoi, mwana akosala bongo

8
00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:17.200
kobanga mpe kolamuka soki makɛlɛlɛ makasi ezali. Miso na bango ezalaka na boyokani na miinda ya kongɛnga, .

9
00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:25.330
kasi bakoki kaka komona makambo moke mpenza. Nzokande, emonaneli na bango ebandi kokola na ndenge ya kokamwa

10
00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:33.240
ntalo. Na boumeli ya pɔsɔ mibale, komona malamu mpenza. Bakoki sikoyo komona mwa makambo mikemike, mingimingi

11
00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:39.780
soki makambo ezali penepene. Langi ezali te, mpe oyo bamonaka ezali patatalu mpo miso na bango

12
00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:45.880
bazali naino ntango nyonso semba te mpe bazali kosala elongo mpo na bososoli ya bozindo. Tango mosusu miso na bango

13
00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:52.730
ekokɔta to ekobima mpo na mwa ntango moke. Yango babengaka yango kokanga miso. Yango esengeli kotika kosalema

14
00:01:52.730 --> 00:02:00.340
na sanza misato. Na sanza moko, komona langi ebandi kokola. Bakozala mingi

15
00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:06.160
kosepela mingi na miso, mingimingi na bilongi. Bakobanda mpe koluka kolanda makambo

16
00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:13.030
oyo ezali kotambola. Bakokóma koyeba mingi makɛlɛlɛ oyo bameseni na yango, ata mpe oyo eyebani mingi

17
00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:19.450
mingongo, lokola libota na bango, mpe babandaka kosangisa makambo oyo bayokaka na oyo bango

18
00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:24.820
kotala. Na sanza misato, miso na bango esengeli ntango nyonso kozala semba mpe kosala elongo mpo na kokela

19
00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:31.620
Bomoni ya 3D. Bososoli wana ya sika ya bozindo esalisaka bango basimba makambo na bosikisiki mingi. Bango

20
00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:37.240
ekozala na likoki ya kolanda makambo oyo ezali kotambola nokinoki. Bobele na ntango yango, makɛlɛlɛ ya ntina

21
00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:45.420
ekobanda kosalama. Na sanza motoba, mwana asengeli koyeba bato oyo ayebi malamu

22
00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:50.960
na bilongi mpe na mingongo na bango. Bakoki mpe kobanda komona makambo oyo ezali mosika

23
00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:57.880
mosika. Na kopusama na mposa ya koyeba, bakosimba maboko, bakotambola epai na bango, mpe, zingazinga

24
00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:03.760
mokolo ya mbotama na bango ya liboso, kotambola. Babblings na bango ezali kokola mpe makelele ekokoma ya liboso

25
00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:13.460
maloba na eteni oyo lokola. Na sanza 18, komona ekómaka mpenza lokola mokóló, atako ezali kaka bongo

26
00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:20.520
mwa moke flou. Bakozala sikoyo na likoki ya koyeba nkombo na bango mpe bakobanda kosalela maloba mingi.

27
00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:28.300
Ba bébé mosusu bakoki kokokisa te makambo wana ya ntina ya bokoli na ntango oyo bakanisaki. Ezali

28
00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:34.210
bantina mingi mpo na likambo yango, mpe mingi bakomisembola. Na ndakisa, bana oyo babotami liboso ya ntango

29
00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:40.920
ekoki kozala na retard, kasi mbala mingi ekangamaka sima na bomwana. Mpo na bamosusu, ekoki kozala na kotingama

30
00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:47.710
mikakatano. Koyeba oyo noki mpo na kopesa lisalisi mpe lisungi ekoki

31
00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:49.210
